WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.205 --> 00:00:13.965
You're safe!"

2
00:00:14.786 --> 00:00:17.868
Perda rushed into Venna's hideout with Darb and Teplo behind her.

3
00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:22.172
While Teplo talked to Venna and her people, Zann's friends pulled him aside.

4
00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:26.175
"Wow, I'm glad to see you guys," Zann said.

5
00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:31.400
Half an hour had passed since Venna had asked him to become king, and he was still stunned.

6
00:00:32.628 --> 00:00:33.529
"What's going on?"

7
00:00:33.869 --> 00:00:34.450
Perda asked.

8
00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:37.452
"That messenger who came to get us wouldn't tell us anything.

9
00:00:38.153 --> 00:00:40.234
Just that he was taking us to you."

10
00:00:40.254 --> 00:00:42.156
"Did you find Gliss?"

11
00:00:42.476 --> 00:00:42.997
Darb added.

12
00:00:43.017 --> 00:00:45.038
"No," Zann said.

13
00:00:45.058 --> 00:00:46.780
"I never made it to the zoo."

14
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:48.942
He quickly told them what had happened.

15
00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:51.364
Perda gasped.

16
00:00:51.664 --> 00:00:53.626
"They want you to be king?"

17
00:00:54.066 --> 00:00:54.706
she exclaimed.

18
00:00:54.726 --> 00:00:56.448
"But you're a kid!"

19
00:00:56.468 --> 00:00:59.290
"That's what I said," Zann agreed.

20
00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.172
"But Venna said it didn't matter.

21
00:01:01.948 --> 00:01:05.831
She said Boz was so popular here that the people would love me.

22
00:01:06.611 --> 00:01:10.014
And she needs someone who's sure to be more popular than Slib."

23
00:01:11.194 --> 00:01:13.476
"So Slib really is trying to take over?"

24
00:01:13.836 --> 00:01:14.356
said Darb.

25
00:01:14.376 --> 00:01:16.958
"That's not all," Zann said.

26
00:01:16.978 --> 00:01:21.521
"Yog says he's pretty sure Slib sent us that password!"

27
00:01:22.322 --> 00:01:23.883
"Why would he do that?"

28
00:01:24.363 --> 00:01:24.923
asked Perda.

29
00:01:25.664 --> 00:01:29.306
"So we'd go out and get captured by trolls," Zann replied.

30
00:01:29.326 --> 00:01:31.548
"Especially me and Gliss.

31
00:01:32.296 --> 00:01:36.439
Yog says Slib resents all Reds and thinks we have too much power."

32
00:01:36.459 --> 00:01:39.301
"Kind of like Jev," Darb said.

33
00:01:40.022 --> 00:01:40.662
Zann nodded.

34
00:01:40.682 --> 00:01:44.185
"Anyway, Venna doesn't want Slib to take over.

35
00:01:44.925 --> 00:01:47.407
That's why she wants me to volunteer to be king."

36
00:01:47.427 --> 00:01:49.328
"So what did you say?"

37
00:01:49.649 --> 00:01:50.289
Perda asked.

38
00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:52.851
"At first I said no way.

39
00:01:53.591 --> 00:01:56.634
But now that I've thought about it Zann shrugged.

40
00:01:56.654 --> 00:01:59.796
"Venna's really powerful and smart.

41
00:02:00.716 --> 00:02:05.319
I figured we might have a better chance of rescuing Gliss and defeating Morb if we all work

42
00:02:05.339 --> 00:02:08.220
together." "Did Venna say she'd help find Gliss?"

43
00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:09.141
Darb asked.

44
00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:14.183
"She promised she'd take care of it as soon as she made things official," Zann said.

45
00:02:14.203 --> 00:02:19.866
"She’s already sent a messenger to her contacts at the palace to tell them I'm ready to become

46
00:02:19.927 --> 00:02:22.188
king." He gulped nervously.

47
00:02:22.888 --> 00:02:25.169
Was he really ready to be king of Magica?

48
00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:30.648
Just then he noticed that Teplo was frowning as he talked to Venna.

49
00:02:30.668 --> 00:02:32.409
By now two other Reds had arrived.

50
00:02:33.349 --> 00:02:36.750
"Maybe we should go see what they're talking about," Zann suggested.

51
00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.591
When the kids walked over, Teplo was speaking.

52
00:02:40.311 --> 00:02:44.432
and I agree that Boz's grandson could rally the citizens," he said.

53
00:02:44.452 --> 00:02:47.233
"But at what cost to Zann himself?

54
00:02:48.053 --> 00:02:51.154
Surely Morb will be on the lookout for him above all others!"

55
00:02:51.174 --> 00:02:54.255
"That may be," Venna said.

56
00:02:54.275 --> 00:02:57.596
"But Zann is brave enough to take on the responsibility.

57
00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.521
We can keep him safe if we work together."

58
00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:06.142
"Don't underestimate Morb, Venna," Teplo warned.

59
00:03:06.863 --> 00:03:07.883
He turned to Zann.

60
00:03:07.903 --> 00:03:09.003
"Listen, my boy.

61
00:03:09.323 --> 00:03:11.604
Think this scheme over carefully."

62
00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.784
"I have," said Zann.

63
00:03:13.804 --> 00:03:16.305
"Venna says she'll help me rescue Gliss.

64
00:03:17.145 --> 00:03:19.566
Then we can work on finding Boz and the others."

65
00:03:19.586 --> 00:03:23.507
"That's right, Zann," Venna said smoothly.

66
00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:25.908
Teplo still looked skeptical.

67
00:03:26.696 --> 00:03:28.577
"How do you propose to do that?"

68
00:03:28.997 --> 00:03:29.757
he asked Venna.

69
00:03:30.457 --> 00:03:31.637
One of the other Reds spoke up.

70
00:03:31.657 --> 00:03:34.138
"This argument is a waste of time.

71
00:03:34.938 --> 00:03:36.219
Zann already said yes.

72
00:03:36.959 --> 00:03:40.320
And Slib is wasting no time trying to solidify his power.

73
00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:45.141
We need to show our candidate to the people of Magica as soon as possible."

74
00:03:46.261 --> 00:03:47.722
"I agree," Venna said.

75
00:03:47.742 --> 00:03:49.822
"Sorry, Teplo.

76
00:03:50.182 --> 00:03:51.743
I'm afraid you're outvoted."

77
00:03:52.483 --> 00:03:54.324
The old man sputtered with indignation.

78
00:03:55.004 --> 00:03:56.869
But she ignored him, turning to Zann.

79
00:03:56.889 --> 00:03:59.211
"It's time to make final preparations.

80
00:03:59.991 --> 00:04:02.894
I want to coach you on what to say when you address the public.

81
00:04:03.634 --> 00:04:09.499
And of course we'll have to do something about your clothes Zann nodded, feeling overwhelmed.

82
00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:13.663
But he was ready to go along with whatever Venna said so they could move on to finding

83
00:04:13.723 --> 00:04:14.543
Gliss and Boz.

84
00:04:15.704 --> 00:04:17.926
Soon he was surrounded by Venna's assistants.

85
00:04:18.687 --> 00:04:21.890
Yog removed Zann's disguise to reveal his hair and freckles.

86
00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.552
Others conjured a fresh set of clothes.

87
00:04:25.908 --> 00:04:27.929
In the midst of all this, the door flew open.

88
00:04:28.589 --> 00:04:32.571
Before Zann could look to see who had arrived, he heard a familiar whistle.

89
00:04:33.271 --> 00:04:34.112
He spun around.

90
00:04:34.132 --> 00:04:38.614
"Zing!" he cried happily as his dragon flew in just ahead of Fala.

91
00:04:38.634 --> 00:04:41.515
"Surprise!" Perda exclaimed.

92
00:04:41.535 --> 00:04:44.336
"We didn't want to tell you in case it didn't work.

93
00:04:45.016 --> 00:04:47.177
But Teplo thought he could get Zing back."

94
00:04:48.258 --> 00:04:52.840
Zann gave the dragon a scratch on the head, ignoring the burn of Zing's fiery breath on his

95
00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:55.809
face. "Good to have you back, little buddy."

96
00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.752
He looked around, wanting to thank Teplo.

97
00:04:59.693 --> 00:05:01.194
The old man was huddled with Fala.

98
00:05:01.414 --> 00:05:02.435
Both of them looked worried.

99
00:05:03.155 --> 00:05:05.898
A moment later Teplo strode to the center of the room.

100
00:05:05.918 --> 00:05:10.101
"My assistant has brought troubling news," he announced.

101
00:05:10.121 --> 00:05:15.605
"She just discovered that the trolls have nearly filled the dragon pen at the zoo with prisoners.

102
00:05:16.366 --> 00:05:21.810
They intend to zap them all to Morb's dungeon as soon as they capture one more Red."

103
00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:22.591
Zann gasped.

104
00:05:23.564 --> 00:05:24.865
"Gliss!" He rushed over to Venna.

105
00:05:24.885 --> 00:05:26.627
"Did you hear that?

106
00:05:26.967 --> 00:05:28.648
This king stuff will have to wait.

107
00:05:29.289 --> 00:05:33.492
We've got to figure out how to rescue Gliss and the others at the zoo—now!"

108
00:05:34.433 --> 00:05:36.195
Venna traded a look with the other Reds.

109
00:05:36.215 --> 00:05:38.797
"I'm sorry, Zann," she said.

110
00:05:38.817 --> 00:05:40.879
"Things have already been set in motion.

111
00:05:41.599 --> 00:05:43.501
We must proceed as planned."

112
00:05:44.202 --> 00:05:46.664
"But you said you'd help me rescue my friend!"

113
00:05:46.684 --> 00:05:51.588
"I said I'll help you after you become king," Venna replied.

114
00:05:52.584 --> 00:05:57.309
"If we don't act now, Slib will be able to take power uncontested."

115
00:05:57.329 --> 00:05:59.131
"But—" Zann began.

116
00:05:59.972 --> 00:06:00.873
Venna interrupted him.

117
00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:02.996
"This is not open for debate.

118
00:06:03.676 --> 00:06:06.700
If you're going to become king, it must be now."

119
00:06:07.561 --> 00:06:08.742
Then Teplo spoke up.

120
00:06:08.762 --> 00:06:13.888
"Well, Zann," he said quietly, "it seems you have a decision to make."
